00:32:38,740 --> 00:32:40,680
We put reclining seats in.

636
00:32:40,780 --> 00:32:42,740
Had cabinets up where they could talk on the phone

637
00:32:42,840 --> 00:32:44,420
or work on their laptop.

638
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:46,420
Had monitors that actually would be

639
00:32:46,421 --> 00:32:47,920
The sky is the limit.

