00:33:14,481 --> 00:33:16,480
Just do it yourself.

650
00:33:16,481 --> 00:33:21,480
In 2021, Rotor-X aircraft manufacturing acquired Rotor-Way,

651
00:33:21,481 --> 00:33:24,480
creators of an experimental helicopter

652
00:33:24,481 --> 00:33:26,480
